{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑すぎてじゃなくて\n寒すぎてなぜかフゥフゥしちゃうこの季節"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BJ6J41725BKKEPC629C1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも。\nハブミズキです。だったら\nサクラズキの韻踏めたのにーと思ったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっとっと\nあんまし面白くない冗談はここまでに(笑)\n　　　　　　　　　　\n　\n５th single 桜月\nミュージックビデオは見てくれたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今晩はオフショット載せますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BK465B8DJ927MNHP6FKC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは\n君の背中を押したかったけど押せなかった組\n(多分言葉責めで現実では押すタイプの三人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BM5D5NGYJTSTWRTDZQFM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キラ子ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後まで\n話も写真も片付けられませんでした\n悔しいので、これからの待ち時間も\n２人で待ち合わせしたいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BN6S1C00JVTZ862R64H7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほにょ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストーブの前でほにょほにょしてたよ\nこんなに見つめられて。。。\nストーブも顔が真っ赤になってますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BP6T1HV6QNZPF9MJ2QZ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土生さんは\n仮面をつけても土生さんですよと言われて\n私も実は真っ赤になってましたなーんて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなで\n凄く感情豊かで穏やかな撮影現場でしたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２月１５日発売です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の想いの詰まった今シングルも\n早く皆さんの心に届きますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4BQ7BPJ2KSVP4JK5EFR07","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最後は森ちゃんが\n撮ってくれた写真で締めくくります😏"}],"source":"archive"}